# Contact form delivery.
#
# Get a free access key at https://web3forms.com — enter santiagomonedero122@gmail.com,
# confirm the address, and paste the key here (and in the Cloudflare Pages
# project: Settings -> Variables -> add VITE_WEB3FORMS_KEY, then redeploy).
#
# Without this the form still works: it opens the visitor's mail client with
# the message pre-filled instead of posting silently.
#
# This value ships in the client bundle by design. It only allows submitting
# to the address it was registered with, and grants nothing else.
VITE_WEB3FORMS_KEY=
